# Build context = repository root (docker build -f backend/Dockerfile .). BuildKit uses this
# file instead of a root .dockerignore for backend/Dockerfile. Allow-list: send only what the
# image copies, never datasets, checkpoints, ONNX files or node_modules.
*
!backend/requirements.txt
!backend/app
!src/__init__.py
!src/data/__init__.py
!src/data/corruptions.py
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
